{%- comment -%}
  Paint colour picker (owner, 2026-09-25: "using the colors on here is it possible to make an
  interactive filtering system for people to click on colors for our valleyjo paints and when
  they click the color the bottle comes up for them to add to cart?", then "can color picker
  help with the army painter, warhammer paints, etc" -> "Sure"). Alternate collection view:
  /collections/<handle>?view=paints (templates/collection.paints.liquid). The brand opened first
  follows the collection (citadel-* -> Citadel, *army-painter* -> The Army Painter, *vallejo* ->
  Vallejo, else all brands); #brand=...&range=... in the address picks brand and range. The page
  banner (snippets/breadcrumb.liquid, template.suffix 'paints') carries the title and the three
  brand logos; this section keeps them in step with the brand tabs.

  The colours come from the exor-binder worker, /paints.json: every Citadel, The Army Painter
  and Vallejo paint on the online store, matched to a colour chart and grouped one swatch per
  colour ({ b: brand, n: name, h: "#RRGGBB" | null, items: [{ r: range, c: code, t: title,
  u: handle, i: image, p: price, a: in stock, v: variant id, s: size }] }). Paints the chart
  does not know show their bottle photo. A swatch opens the bottle (photo, code, price, stock,
  Add to cart via /cart/add.js) and the closest colour from each other brand (CIEDE2000 on the
  chart colours; washes only match washes, Contrast/Speedpaint/Xpress only each other,
  metallics only metallics, primers and sprays only each other). Colour values: Miniature Painter Pro's open paint list.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign xg_h = collection.handle | default: ''
  assign xg_brand = 'All'
  if xg_h contains 'citadel'
    assign xg_brand = 'Citadel'
  elsif xg_h contains 'army-painter'
    assign xg_brand = 'The Army Painter'
  elsif xg_h contains 'vallejo'
    assign xg_brand = 'Vallejo'
  endif
-%}
<div class="xg-pp page-width" data-brand="{{ xg_brand }}" data-src="https://exor-binder.nevski.workers.dev/paints.json">
  <div class="xg-pp__head">
    <p class="xg-pp__sub">Tap a colour to see the bottle and its closest match from the other brands. On-screen colours are approximate. <a class="xg-pp__all" href="#" hidden></a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="xg-pp__brands" role="tablist" aria-label="Brand"></div>
  <div class="xg-pp__bar">
    <div class="xg-pp__ranges" role="tablist" aria-label="Paint range"></div>
    <div class="xg-pp__tools">
      <input class="xg-pp__q" type="search" placeholder="Search colours" aria-label="Search colours">
      <label class="xg-pp__stock"><input type="checkbox" checked> In stock only</label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="xg-pp__families" aria-label="Colour family"></div>
  <p class="xg-pp__count" aria-live="polite">Loading colours…</p>
  <div class="xg-pp__grid"></div>
  <button type="button" class="xg-pp__more" hidden>Show more colours</button>

  <div class="xg-pp__sheet" hidden>
    <div class="xg-pp__backdrop" data-close></div>
    <div class="xg-pp__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="xg-pp-name">
      <button class="xg-pp__x" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <div class="xg-pp__photo"><img alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="xg-pp__info">
        <div class="xg-pp__chip"></div>
        <p class="xg-pp__range"></p>
        <h3 id="xg-pp-name" class="xg-pp__name"></h3>
        <div class="xg-pp__opts" role="group" aria-label="Bottle" hidden></div>
        <p class="xg-pp__price"></p>
        <p class="xg-pp__avail"></p>
        <div class="xg-pp__buy">
          <div class="xg-pp__qty"><button type="button" data-q="-1" aria-label="Less">&minus;</button><input type="number" min="1" value="1" aria-label="Quantity"><button type="button" data-q="1" aria-label="More">+</button></div>
          <button class="xg-pp__add btn" type="button">Add to cart</button>
        </div>
        <p class="xg-pp__msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <a class="xg-pp__link" href="#">Full product page &rsaquo;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="xg-pp__match" hidden>
        <p class="xg-pp__mh">Closest from other brands</p>
        <div class="xg-pp__ml"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .xg-pp { padding: 20px 0 40px; font-family: var(--xg-font-body); color: var(--xg-text); }
  .xg-pp__sub { color: var(--xg-muted); margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; }
  .xg-pp__sub a { color: var(--xg-red); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  .xg-pp__brands { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .xg-pp__brands button { font: 700 14px/1 var(--xg-font-body); border: 2px solid var(--xg-border); background: var(--xg-surface); color: var(--xg-ink); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; }
  .xg-pp__brands button span { opacity: .65; font-weight: 500; margin-left: 5px; }
  .xg-pp__brands button[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--xg-ink); background: var(--xg-ink); color: var(--xg-surface); }
  .xg-pp__bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 16px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .xg-pp__ranges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .xg-pp__ranges:empty { display: none; }
  .xg-pp__ranges button, .xg-pp__families button { font: 600 13px/1 var(--xg-font-body); border: 1px solid var(--xg-border); background: var(--xg-surface); color: var(--xg-ink); border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 13px; cursor: pointer; }
  .xg-pp__ranges button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--xg-red); border-color: var(--xg-red); color: #fff; }
  .xg-pp__ranges button span { opacity: .7; font-weight: 500; margin-left: 4px; }
  .xg-pp__tools { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-left: auto; }
  .xg-pp__q { font: 14px var(--xg-font-body); padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--xg-border); background: var(--xg-surface); color: var(--xg-ink); min-width: 190px; }
  .xg-pp__stock { font-size: 13px; color: var(--xg-text); display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin: 0; white-space: nowrap; }
  .xg-pp__families { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .xg-pp__families button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 6px 12px 6px 7px; }
  .xg-pp__families button i { width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.18); }
  .xg-pp__families button[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--xg-ink); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--xg-ink); }
  .xg-pp__count { font-size: 13px; color: var(--xg-muted); margin: 6px 0 14px; }
  .xg-pp__more { display: block; margin: 18px auto 0; padding: 9px 18px; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 999px; background: none; color: inherit; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; opacity: .8; }
  .xg-pp__more[hidden] { display: none; }
  .xg-pp__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(92px, 1fr)); gap: 16px 10px; }
  .xg-pp__sw { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start; background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; color: var(--xg-text); font: 500 12px/1.25 var(--xg-font-body); }
  .xg-pp__dot { display: block; width: 64px; height: 64px; margin: 0 auto 7px; border-radius: 50%; position: relative;
    box-shadow: inset 0 -8px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28), inset 0 6px 10px rgba(255,255,255,.28), 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    transition: transform .15s ease; }
  .xg-pp__dot.is-metal { background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,.55) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 38%, rgba(0,0,0,.25) 70%, rgba(255,255,255,.35) 100%) !important; }
  .xg-pp__dot.is-photo { background: #fff center 42% / 150% no-repeat; }
  .xg-pp__sw:hover .xg-pp__dot, .xg-pp__sw:focus-visible .xg-pp__dot { transform: scale(1.08); }
  .xg-pp__sw.is-out { opacity: .42; }
  .xg-pp__sw.is-out .xg-pp__dot::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 8px; right: 8px; top: 50%; height: 2px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.85); transform: rotate(-35deg); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .xg-pp__code { display: block; color: var(--xg-muted); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 2px; }
